# Drizzle migrations

Never hand-edit [`apps/server/drizzle/*.sql`](apps/server/drizzle/) or [`apps/server/drizzle/meta/_journal.json`](apps/server/drizzle/meta/_journal.json). Same rule as generated `packages/evm/definitions/`.

**Schema change workflow:**

1. Edit [`apps/server/lib/platform/db/schema/`](apps/server/lib/platform/db/schema/)
2. `bun run db -- push local` (dev sync)
3. `bun run db -- generate` (prod artifact)
4. Commit **all** files under `apps/server/drizzle/` (SQL + `meta/`)
5. `bun run db -- migrate sandbox` before prod

**Custom SQL / seeds:** `drizzle-kit generate --custom --name=<tag>` only.

**If `generate` re-creates existing tables/columns:** stop - snapshot chain is broken; run integrity check, do not commit.

**Profiles:** local/staging = `push`. sandbox/production = `generate` + `migrate` only (never `push`).

Drift gate: `bun run db -- migration-check` (CI via `sanity --ci`).
